# Supabase SQL

- Names: `gm_` tables, RPCs, and buckets only. This project shares a database with Ultimate POS, Cinnamon POS, and Inpin.
- New work gets a new file `00N_gm_deskripsi.sql`. Do not edit an older migration that may already have been run.
- Add RLS and grants explicitly. Avoid `SECURITY DEFINER` unless there is a clear reason.
- Do not drop or rename unprefixed, `cn_`, or `ip_` objects.
- Do not drop or rename columns the Flutter app already reads unless you plan a compatible rollout.

```sql
-- ❌ BAD
alter table locations add column foo text;

-- ✅ GOOD
alter table gm_locations add column foo text;
```
